[I] Fast caching software with a focus on low latency and cpu efficiency

[T] Pogocache is fast caching software built from scratch with a focus on low
[T] latency and cpu efficency.

[U] https://pogocache.com/

[A] Josh Baker
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/database
[F] CROSS

[L] AGPL
[V] 1.3.2

[D] 15a2eeadc83c64a33e31fef4db5c98316dee29edfc8a721c18cd0bc1 pogocache-1.3.2.tar.gz https://github.com/tidwall/pogocache/archive/1.3.2/

makeinstopt=

# no network cloned and cross configured deps, use the system libraries
var_append makeopt ' ' "NOJEMALLOC=1 NOMIMALLOC=1 DEPS= CLIBS='-lssl -lcrypto -luring -lm -lpthread'"
hook_add postmake 5 'install -D -m 755 pogocache $root$bindir/pogocache'
